  "notes": [
    "**Permitir** is a regular **-IR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **permitido** (regular)",
    "Often followed by infinitive: *permitir hacer algo* (to allow to do something)",
    "Can be used with indirect object: *Me permite entrar* (He/She allows me to enter)",
    "Common usage: *permitir el acceso* (to allow access), *¿Me permite?* (May I? / Excuse me)",
    "Related noun: **el permiso** (permission, permit)",
    "Opposite: **prohibir** (to prohibit, to forbid)",
    "Expression: *Si me lo permite* (If you allow me / If I may)"
  ],
